<title>POLAND: IZOLACJA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 4.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>IZOLACJA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 4.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.34 vs   1.82</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.43 vs   2.73</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.55 vs   2.95</p>
<p> Sales		   25.69 vs  16.85</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.83 vs   4.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.31 vs   7.45</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.43 vs   8.41</p>
<p> Sales		   87.81 vs  57.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish insulation materials maker is</p>
<p>Izolacja SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
